    "body": "I went back to 0.8.60 testing ALL versions in between.\nAll versions (except 0.8.60) crashed resulting with the same behavior by disabling copy (ctrl-c) and impacting other extensions as well.\n\nThe 0.8.60 also crashed and other extensions are also prevented to work but copy still work, here is the logs for 0.8.60 crash:\n```\n2025-01-20 17:56:54.074 [error] RangeError: path should be a `path.relative()`d string, but got \"../../../.continue/config.json\"\n\tat throwError (/*****/com.visualstudio.code/data/vscode/extensions/continue.continue-0.8.60/out/extension.js:71825:13)\n\tat checkPath (/*****/com.visualstudio.code/data/vscode/extensions/continue.continue-0.8.60/out/extension.js:71839:16)\n\tat Ignore2._test (/*****/com.visualstudio.code/data/vscode/extensions/continue.continue-0.8.60/out/extension.js:71927:9)\n\tat Ignore2.ignores (/*****/com.visualstudio.code/data/vscode/extensions/continue.continue-0.8.60/out/extension.js:71954:21)\n\tat (/*****/com.visualstudio.code/data/vscode/extensions/continue.continue-0.8.60/out/extension.js:541456:31\n2025-01-20 17:56:55.450 [error] TypeError: Cannot read properties of undefined (reading 'apply')\n\tat e3.<computed> (/*****/com.visualstudio.code/data/vscode/extensions/continue.continue-0.8.60/out/extension.js:85639:63)\n\tat wasm://wasm/0055765a:wasm-function[15]:0x29b5\n\tat wasm://wasm/000b54aa:wasm-function[234]:0x25635\n\tat _Parser.parse (/*****/com.visualstudio.code/data/vscode/extensions/continue.continue-0.8.60/out/extension.js:86312:29)\n\tat _ImportDefinitionsService._getFileInfo (/*****/com.visualstudio.code/data/vscode/extensions/continue.continue-0.8.60/out/extension.js:87292:28)\n\tat async PrecalculatedLruCache.initKey (/*****/com.visualstudio.code/data/vscode/extensions/continue.continue-0.8.60/out/extension.js:85170:25)\n```\n\nI _continue_ to test but this is getting really annoying.",
