    "body": "I would like to add that when the following info/error messages occur, the Continue extension stops working; no more tab autocomplete. But if I kill the process, `run0 kill -9 462689`, the extension is working again as well as the copy and paste.\n``` yaml\n2025-01-21 08:08:28.794 [info] Extension host (LocalProcess pid: 462689) is unresponsive.\n2025-01-21 08:08:30.438 [info] UNRESPONSIVE extension host: starting to profile NOW\n2025-01-21 08:08:47.646 [error] Error: Aborted onWillSaveTextDocument-event after 1750ms\n    at vscode-file://vscode-app/usr/share/code/resources/app/out/vs/workbench/workbench.desktop.main.js:767:9409\n```\n",
