    "body": "The problem still occurs with pre-release version **0.9.262**. After 5 minutes of using tab autocomplete in bash script, the extension host become unresponsive. It's the exact same problem.\n\nHere is the VSCode's Window console log:\n```pgsql\n2025-02-11-17:02:57.595 [error] [Window] An unknown error occurred. Please consult the log for more details.\n2025-02-11-17:03:35.691 [info] [Window] Extension host (LocalProcess pid: 3286138) is unresponsive.\n2025-02-11-17:03:37.134 [info] [Window] UNRESPONSIVE extension host: starting to profile NOW\n```\n\nVSCode version:\n```text\nVersion: 1.97.0\nCommit: 33fc5a94a3f99ebe7087e8fe79fbe1d37a251016\nDate: 2025-02-04T22:41:26.688Z\nElectron: 32.2.7\nElectronBuildId: 10660205\nChromium: 128.0.6613.186\nNode.js: 20.18.1\nV8: 12.8.374.38-electron.0\nOS: Linux x64 6.12.11-200.fc41.x86_64\n```\n",
